    "answer": "myself",
    "mnemonic": "\"When it comes to <kanji>somebody</kanji> like my<kanji>self</kanji>... aka <kanji>I</kanji>...\" When you say this you're really saying \"<vocabulary>personally</vocabulary>\" or \"<vocabulary>as for me</vocabulary>.\"",
